    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub></math></p><p>Total internal reflection will happen.</p>",
